00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:13.650
Aquí es donde equilibras

00:17:13.650 --> 00:17:14.230
tu precisión

00:17:14.230 --> 00:17:14.930
con tu solidez.

00:17:15.830 --> 00:17:16.830
En un contexto financiero

00:17:16.830 --> 00:17:17.310
